! ACKBAR's SIS2 overrides for the stock MOM6-examples OM_1deg case.
!
! Same argument as the MOM_override beside this file, with one difference that
! matters: SIS2 has no `ENABLE_BUGS_BY_DEFAULT`, so there is no master switch
! and every flag has to be named.
!
! Two of these are stated in SIS_input with a trailing comment claiming the
! default is True. It is not, and has not been since the consortium default
! changes; the comment is a fossil of when the file was written. Trust the
! parameter doc the model writes, never the comment in the case:
!
!     grep -E '_BUG[A-Z_]* = True' SIS_parameter_doc.all
!
! The stock case also ships `ADD_DIURNAL_SW = False` in its own SIS_override,
! with a note that it must only be used in ice-ocean mode and not fully
! coupled. That is the case's setting, not ACKBAR's, and this file replaces the
! case's rather than adding to it, so it is restated here to preserve it.

ADD_DIURNAL_SW = False ! This must ONLY be used in the ice-ocean mode, NOT fully coupled mode.

#override USE_TRIPOLAR_GEOLONB_BUG = False  ! SIS_input:54
#override GRID_ROTATION_ANGLE_BUGS = False  ! SIS_input:61
#override INCONSISTENT_COVER_BUG = False    ! SIS_input:116, comment there is stale
#override CFL_MASS_NEGLECT_BUG = False      ! SIS_input:133, comment there is stale
